+ *
+ *    If the type is PD_ATTR_TYPE_BUFFER, then there is a buffer pointer
+ *    in the structure to pass larger chunks of data. Originator owns the
+ *    buffer.
+ *      buffer_size    - size of the buffer
+ *
+ *      buffer         - pointer to buffer
+ *
+ */
